{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2100e4d49c39fc3ce274de360e96d8605bf467c8d2dafe022fdd831c3691375d","ja":"脱出アトラクションをPR！","zh":"为逃脱项目宣传！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7fa4efa462bfcc8e3ffcd1d9a8fb43537be911230a043649e9927990d6ee2f5d","ja":"北東エリアのツアー公演が終わって数週間後……。","zh":"东北地区的巡演公演结束几周后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"43467b98d4fa38cec9727e71d436d91302b17dd635d0e80d09d46a3109cf6822","ja":"みんな見てる～？　\nたまきたち、今日はお知らせがあるんだ！","zh":"大家都在看吗～？  \n环和大家今天有件事要通知你们！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"46ab8e4132d6a36bf25f20f22dd035acc29b8b482c463a6b2c37d936400615a5","ja":"なんと、あたし達がツアーでお披露目した劇と、脱出\nアトラクションがコラボすることになったんだよぉ～！","zh":"没想到，我们在巡演中首次演出的剧目，竟然要和逃脱类游乐设施联动了哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"eedb83f507e2b43387bbdb8cc494629715373d25c7a6aa0b7a2bba7dd79291a1","ja":"『厄災』に苦しめられる北の果てにある、\n寒村に迷い込んだあなた。","zh":"在饱受『灾厄』折磨的北方尽头，你迷失在了一个寒冷的村庄里。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"51b66600bd98a1c39e2f657699ace9fdd8a91473c15aa18ae1418c511350600e","ja":"無事に村から脱出できるかしら？\nそれとも……？","zh":"能否顺利从村子里逃出去呢？\n还是说……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5ce729c066349525b8f384b57590cc973964f810d50c8056a9d40881fb89267e","ja":"うふふ。気になってきた人はぜひ、\nアトラクションに挑戦してみてちょうだいね♪","zh":"呵呵。如果开始感兴趣了，就请务必来挑战一下游乐设施哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ce255cea8f42dfc86da7555a5397e125b3d2882d8030a2179fb9fa467a90b602","ja":"私らの劇に負けへんくらいに、\nハラハラドキドキの内容やで！","zh":"内容惊险刺激，绝不逊色于我们的剧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"dfadf0ad3da3f6a7485e9e89b228fced6936d8f2a97159bd03f3a4ea8d76ff59","ja":"本格的な脱出アトラクションと、ダークなストーリーの\n世界。存分に楽しめること間違いなし！","zh":"这是一个拥有正统逃脱式游乐设施和黑暗故事的世界。保证能让你尽情享受！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"be7bd55e9e0da138fead18e6706e90972640d50b18857e1f20213d51a5055005","ja":"この村で……待ってるわよ！","zh":"我会在这个村子里……等着你哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"2adb25bc0ece9c397cb0cabf8decc242a5ef4d1fdcc2fed4eef2ea7a1ac33e77","ja":"PR動画、一発OKだって！\nスタッフさんたち褒めてくれてたわよ♪","zh":"PR视频一次就通过啦！\n工作人员们都夸你了哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d3814e6762257f7b17f66e290f30a2ca6c6273712ee5444c39bb2b1eaa5e3d52","ja":"よかった～。\nお客さん、たくさん来てくれるといいね～。","zh":"太好了～。\n希望能有很多客人来～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"5cb69c6668572e2c549cf06bf3e742e19b99cb5bf8357eb5eb903ce1af6a3f94","ja":"そうね！　たくさんの人に、\n私達の劇の世界を楽しんでもらいたいわ。","zh":"没错！我希望能让更多人享受我们戏剧的世界。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"30bf7b124b916d3bf77019cb5fd19897dd342c0731ca0c515c82852576be079d","ja":"……ふふふっ、こういうのってすごくいいわね。\nツアーが終わったあとも、広がっていく感じがして♪","zh":"……呵呵，这种感觉真是太棒了。\n即使巡演结束后，也仿佛还在不断扩散♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"49dca35f1c564b80f4a0336f7a2652dc6a01c6b4a3a3e81d5205d44191ba1a52","ja":"いたいた！\nふたりともここにいたんですね～！","zh":"找到了！\n原来你们两个人都在这里呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1612c7a6f62e8e9bb20597abe371cfae6eb36945a956f7fd8ed3588adc2d0e49","ja":"このあと、私らで脱出アトラクションの先行体験して\nみませんか～って言われたんですけど、どうします？","zh":"有人问我们接下来要不要先体验一下逃脱类游乐设施～，我们怎么办？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"9f85acfb982236d7b47ec243bc558bef10e2acd454aeae96f5a472b3cd3f1d54","ja":"ええっ！？　そんなの、もちろん……\n挑戦するに決まってるじゃない！","zh":"诶！？那种事，当然是……\n肯定要挑战啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"91df29a481fdec0aa6ee57996f5bc7e8b787d745f6cf727b21b9801afc778ed9","ja":"えへへ、あたしもだよぉ。\nみんなと一緒にゴールできたら、うれしいべさ。","zh":"嘿嘿，我也是哦。\n要是能和大家一起到达终点，我会很开心的呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_996.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"e0f664793d0d4af8bebde9ec5c981b68781b761fb792f89e76c7f851f615a5f7","ja":"決まりですね！\n5人で絶対、脱出しましょっ！","zh":"就这么定了！\n我们5个人一定要逃出去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
